WEBVTT

00:01.953 --> 00:08.687
**
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:08.687 --> 00:11.853
- ORDER UP!
- 订购！

00:11.853 --> 00:13.253
- HERE.
[clank]
- 这里。
[铮铮]

00:13.253 --> 00:14.687
- GOO!
- 粘性物！

00:14.687 --> 00:15.687
- HEY, THERE.
- 嘿。

00:15.687 --> 00:16.687
- [raspberry]
- [覆盆子]

00:16.687 --> 00:18.320
NUM, NUM!
数，数！

00:18.320 --> 00:21.987
- AW, DOES BABY
WANT A KRABBY PATTY, HMM?
- 哇，宝贝吗？
想要一份蟹肉饼，嗯？

00:21.987 --> 00:24.053
- AW.
- AW。
- AW。
- AW。
- AW。
- AW。
- AW。
- AW。

00:24.053 --> 00:28.053
- BABY'S FIRST KRABBY PATTY.
[sniffles]
- 宝宝的第一个蟹肉饼。
[抽鼻子]

00:31.920 --> 00:34.787
- THAT DIABOLICAL FIEND!
- 那个恶魔！

00:34.787 --> 00:37.187
- I CAN'T BELIEVE
THIS IS WORKING!
- 我不敢相信
这是有效的！

00:37.187 --> 00:39.720
IT'S LIKE TAKING CANDY
FROM A BABY--
就像吃糖果一样
从婴儿开始——

00:39.720 --> 00:41.253
WITH A BABY.
带着婴儿。

00:41.253 --> 00:45.353
- STOP RIGHT THERE,
YOU THIEVIN' INFANT!
- 就停在那里，
你这个小偷婴儿！

00:45.353 --> 00:49.353
[mechanical ratcheting]
[机械棘轮]

00:49.353 --> 00:51.853
[growls]
[咆哮]

00:51.853 --> 00:53.487
- YI-EEH! THAT'S HARSH.
- 哎呀！这太严酷了。

00:53.487 --> 00:55.753
- SO YOU THOUGHT YOU COULD
PULL A FAST ONE, EH?
- 所以你认为你可以
拉一个快的，呃？

00:55.753 --> 00:58.420
NOW, COME OUT OF THERE,
YOU LITTLE PEST!
现在，从那里出来，
你这个小害虫！

00:58.420 --> 01:00.587
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:00.587 --> 01:02.053
- [gasps]
WHAT'S HE DOING?
- [喘气]
他在做什么？

01:02.053 --> 01:04.687
YOU LEAVE
THAT POOR BABY ALONE!
你离开
那个可怜的孩子独自一人！

01:04.687 --> 01:06.320
- OKAY.
- 好的。

01:06.320 --> 01:09.520
I GUESS WE'RE GONNA HAVE
TO DO THIS THE HARD WAY.
我想我们将会有
要以困难的方式做到这一点。

01:09.520 --> 01:10.853
- MR. KRABS, NO!
- 先生。蟹蟹，不！

01:10.853 --> 01:11.887
DON'T DO IT!
不要这样做！

01:11.887 --> 01:14.687
[grunts]
[rip]
[咕哝]
[撕裂]

01:14.687 --> 01:16.687
- OOH! OH...
[thump]
- 哦！哦...
[扑通]

01:16.687 --> 01:18.053
- OH!
[thump]
- 哦！
[扑通]

01:18.053 --> 01:19.953
- OH, CALM DOWN!
- 哦，冷静点！

01:19.953 --> 01:21.453
IT'S JUST PLANKTON.
这只是浮游生物。

01:21.453 --> 01:22.687
[pop]
[流行音乐]

01:22.687 --> 01:25.687
- SEE?
- UH...GOO-GOO?
- 看？
- 呃...咕咕？

01:25.687 --> 01:27.353
- HOW DARE YOU!
- 你怎么敢！

01:27.353 --> 01:29.053
YOU TOYED WITH OUR EMOTIONS!
你玩弄了我们的感情！

01:29.053 --> 01:30.687
[squish]
- OW.
[挤压]
-哦。

01:30.687 --> 01:32.253
- FACE IT, PLANKTON.
- 面对现实吧，浮游生物。

01:32.253 --> 01:34.020
YOU'RE NEVER GONNA WIN.
你永远不会赢。

01:34.020 --> 01:37.687
I'LL ALWAYS BE
ONE STEP...AHEAD.
我将永远是
领先一步...

01:37.687 --> 01:39.353
[chuckles]
[笑声]

01:39.353 --> 01:42.420
NOW, WHY DON'T YOU GO BACK
TO WHERE YOU CAME FROM,
现在，你为什么不回去
到你来自哪里，

01:42.420 --> 01:43.420
YOU LITTLE BRAT.
你这个小家伙。

01:43.420 --> 01:44.453
[whoosh, crash]
[嗖嗖，崩溃]

01:44.453 --> 01:45.687
all: [gasp]
全体：[喘气]

01:45.687 --> 01:46.720
- UH-OH.
- 呃-哦。

01:46.720 --> 01:49.820
- YOU MONSTER!
- HOW DARE YOU!
- 你这个怪物！
- 你怎么敢！

01:51.020 --> 01:53.553
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

01:53.553 --> 01:57.820
- AWW, DIDDUMS FAIL
TO GET A KRABBY PATTY AGAIN?
- 哇哦，迪达姆失败了
想要再吃一份蟹肉饼吗？

01:57.820 --> 01:58.853
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

01:58.853 --> 02:00.787
- STOP PATRONIZING ME!
- 别再光顾我了！

02:00.787 --> 02:04.320
WHY DOES EVERY SINGLE PLAN
FALL APART?
为什么每一个计划
分崩离析？

02:04.320 --> 02:06.553
IT'S JUST A STUPID SANDWICH!
这只是一个愚蠢的三明治！

02:06.553 --> 02:09.020
I TELL YOU,
IT'S WEARING ME DOWN!
我告诉你，
这让我精疲力竭！

02:09.020 --> 02:11.920
- YOU NEED
TO STOP OBSESSING OVER IT.
- 你需要
停止沉迷于此。

02:11.920 --> 02:14.453
RELAX. GET A HOBBY
OR SOMETHING.
放松。培养一个爱好
或者什么。

02:14.453 --> 02:16.687
- I HATE TO ADMIT IT,
COMPUTER WIFE,
- 我不愿意承认这一点
电脑妻子，

02:16.687 --> 02:17.920
BUT YOU'RE PROBABLY RIGHT.
但你可能是对的。

02:17.920 --> 02:19.253
I NEED SOMETHING
我需要一些东西

02:19.253 --> 02:21.953
TO TAKE MY MIND OFF
THAT BLASTED SECRET FORMULA
让我放下心来
那个该死的秘密配方

02:21.953 --> 02:23.087
FOR A WHILE.
一阵子。

02:23.087 --> 02:24.987
BUT WHAT?
- I KNOW.
但是什么？
- 我知道。

02:24.987 --> 02:27.987
HOW ABOUT TAKING CARE
OF AN INFERIOR LIFE-FORM?
如何照顾
低等生命形式？

02:27.987 --> 02:29.587
- YOU MEAN A PET?
- 你是说宠物吗？

02:29.587 --> 02:32.487
THAT'S A GREAT IDEA!
这是个好主意！

02:32.487 --> 02:34.253
BUT HOW WILL I FIND A PET
但我怎样才能找到宠物

02:34.253 --> 02:36.253
THAT FITS
MY DYNAMIC PERSONALITY?
适合
我的个性充满活力？

02:36.253 --> 02:37.487
- PLANKTON.
- [screams]
- 浮游生物。
- [尖叫]

02:37.487 --> 02:39.487
- I HAVE THE PERFECT SOLUTION
TO YOUR PROBLEM.
- 我有完美的解决方案
针对您的问题。

02:39.487 --> 02:40.853
- SPONGEBOB?
- 海绵宝宝？

02:40.853 --> 02:43.420
HOW COULD YOU
POSSIBLY HELP ME?
你怎么可以
可以帮助我吗？

02:43.420 --> 02:45.587
- YOU SHOULD TRY
THE LOCAL ANIMAL SHELTER.
- 你应该尝试
当地的动物收容所。

02:45.587 --> 02:47.487
THAT'S WHERE I FOUND
MY GARY.
这就是我发现的地方
我的加里。

02:47.487 --> 02:48.687
- OH, YEAH?
- 哦，是吗？

02:48.687 --> 02:51.920
PERHAPS YOU'RE
ON TO SOMETHING THERE.
也许你是
去那里做某事。

02:51.920 --> 02:53.920
- HERE IT IS.
- 这里是。

02:53.920 --> 02:55.353
THE BIKINI BOTTOM
ANIMAL SHELTER.
比基尼泳裤
动物收容所。

02:55.353 --> 02:57.887
[pets barking]
YOUR PERFECT PET AWAITS.
[宠物吠叫]
您的完美宠物正在等待着您。

02:57.887 --> 03:00.720
NOW, IF YOU JUST LISTEN
TO YOUR HEART,
现在，只要你听着
致你的心，

03:00.720 --> 03:02.387
YOU'LL BE ABLE
TO PICK OUT THE RIGHT PET
你一定能够
选择合适的宠物

03:02.387 --> 03:03.753
AS SOON AS YOU SEE IT.
一看到它。

03:03.753 --> 03:06.453
[barking continues]
- HMM. TOO BIG.
[吠叫继续]
- 嗯。太大了。

03:06.453 --> 03:08.220
TOO SLOPPY.
太马虎了。

03:08.220 --> 03:10.287
- DUH.
- TOO STUPID.
- 呃。
- 太愚蠢了。

03:10.287 --> 03:11.720
- HI, SPONGEBOB.
- 嗨，海绵宝宝。

03:11.720 --> 03:13.020
- HEY, PATRICK.
- 嘿，帕特里克。

03:13.020 --> 03:14.753
OH! OH!
WHAT ABOUT THIS ONE?
哦！哦！
这个怎么样？

03:14.753 --> 03:16.487
- ARE YOU KIDDING ME?
- 你在开玩笑吧？

03:16.487 --> 03:18.153
ALGAE ON A ROCK?
岩石上的藻类？

03:18.153 --> 03:20.087
I WANT A PET,
NOT A PLANT.
我想要一只宠物，
不是植物。

03:20.087 --> 03:21.687
IT'S NO USE.
这没有用。

03:21.687 --> 03:22.820
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

03:22.820 --> 03:24.220
- THERE'S NOTHING FOR ME HERE.
- 这里没有什么适合我的。

03:24.220 --> 03:25.453
[screams]
[尖叫声]

03:25.453 --> 03:27.153
- OH, NO!
PLANKTON!
- 哦，不！
浮游生物！

03:27.153 --> 03:29.020
- YOU KNOW,
I CAN'T SAY I'M SURPRISED.
- 你知道，
我不能说我很惊讶。

03:29.020 --> 03:32.887
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

03:32.887 --> 03:34.820
[growls, chomps]
[咆哮，咀嚼]

03:34.820 --> 03:36.320
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

03:36.320 --> 03:37.420
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

03:37.420 --> 03:41.087
- HEY THERE, LITTLE GUY.
- 嘿，小家伙。

03:41.087 --> 03:43.720
- [barks]
- LOOKS LIKE WE HAVE A WINNER.
- [吠叫]
- 看起来我们有一个赢家。

03:43.720 --> 03:45.520
- OH, SO CUTE!
- 哦，太可爱了！

03:45.520 --> 03:46.687
WHATCHA GONNA CALL HIM?
该怎么称呼他？

03:46.687 --> 03:49.020
HE LOOKS LIKE A "SPOT" TO ME.
他对我来说就像一个“点”。

03:49.020 --> 03:50.353
- [chomps, growling]
- [咀嚼，咆哮]

03:50.353 --> 03:53.687
- THAT NAME PROVOKES
A VIOLENT REACTION.
- 这个名字激怒了
激烈的反应。

03:53.687 --> 03:56.320
SPOT IT IS!
发现它了！

03:56.320 --> 03:59.687
- [barks, panting]
- [吠叫，气喘吁吁]

03:59.687 --> 04:01.520
- WELL, SPOT.
- 好吧，点。

04:01.520 --> 04:03.453
I'M YOUR NEW OWNER,
我是你的新主人，

04:03.453 --> 04:07.920
SO SHOWER ME
WITH LOVE AND AFFECTION.
所以给我洗澡吧
充满爱和感情。

04:07.920 --> 04:09.187
KAREN,
凯伦，

04:09.187 --> 04:11.220
IT'S NOT GIVING ME
UNCONDITIONAL LOVE.
它没有给我
无条件的爱。

04:11.220 --> 04:13.020
I THINK IT'S DEFECTIVE.
我认为它有缺陷。

04:13.020 --> 04:15.220
- YOU'RE GONNA HAVE
TO TRAIN HIM TO DO THAT.
- 你将会有
训练他这样做。

04:15.220 --> 04:17.020
- I TRAIN HIM?
- 我训练他？

04:17.020 --> 04:18.520
[sighs]
I'LL GIVE IT A SHOT.
[叹气]
我会尝试一下。

04:18.520 --> 04:20.187
ALL RIGHT, SPOT.
好吧，点。

04:20.187 --> 04:22.020
LET'S START
WITH SOMETHING EASY.
让我们开始吧
简单的事情。

04:22.020 --> 04:25.553
STAY.
停留。

04:25.553 --> 04:27.453
GOOD BOY.
NOW SIT.
好孩子。
现在坐下。

04:27.453 --> 04:29.687
[squishing]
[压扁]

04:29.687 --> 04:31.053
VERY GOOD!
非常好！

04:31.053 --> 04:33.320
NOW ROLL OVER.
现在翻身。

04:33.320 --> 04:35.187
- [barks]
- EXCELLENT!
- [吠叫]
- 太棒了！

04:35.187 --> 04:36.553
NOW SHAKE.
现在摇一摇。

04:36.553 --> 04:39.053
[rumbling, clattering]
[隆隆声，咔哒声]

04:39.053 --> 04:40.220
WOW!
哇！

04:40.220 --> 04:42.353
THAT'S ONE MEAN SHAKE
YOU GOT THERE.
这是一次剧烈的震动
你到了。

04:42.353 --> 04:45.287
I THINK WE SHOULD BURN OFF
SOME OF THAT EXTRA ENERGY.
我认为我们应该燃烧掉
一些额外的能量。

04:45.287 --> 04:48.953
WOULD YOU LIKE
TO GO WALKIES?
你愿意吗
去散步吗？

04:48.953 --> 04:52.120
I'LL ASSUME THAT'S A YES.
我假设这是肯定的。

04:52.120 --> 04:53.153
MARCH!
行进！

04:53.153 --> 04:56.353
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

04:56.353 --> 04:59.687
- [whistles cheerfully]
- [愉快地吹口哨]

04:59.687 --> 05:03.453
[whistling peters out]
[口哨声逐渐消失]

05:03.453 --> 05:05.453
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

05:05.453 --> 05:06.687
PHEW!
唷！

05:06.687 --> 05:08.853
WE MUST'VE WALKED FOR MILES.
我们一定已经走了好几英里了。

05:08.853 --> 05:11.420
[squishes]
[压扁]

05:11.420 --> 05:14.487
I GUESS OUR LEGS
ARE TOO SHORT FOR WALKIES.
我猜我们的腿
对于步行来说太短了。

05:14.487 --> 05:18.687
HOW ABOUT
A NICE ROUND OF FETCH?
怎么样
一轮漂亮的取球？

05:18.687 --> 05:22.253
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:22.253 --> 05:23.353
FETCH!
拿来！

05:23.353 --> 05:25.353
[splat]
[啪嗒]

05:25.353 --> 05:26.387
[snap]
[折断]

05:26.387 --> 05:27.420
[screams]
[尖叫声]

05:27.420 --> 05:28.587
OH, NO.
哦，不。

05:28.587 --> 05:29.753
WHAT HAVE I DONE?
我做了什么？

05:29.753 --> 05:32.387
I'M A TERRIBLE PET OWNER!
TERRIBLE!
我是一个糟糕的宠物主人！
糟糕的！

05:32.387 --> 05:33.853
KAREN!
凯伦！

05:33.853 --> 05:35.420
WE'RE GONNA NEED ANOTHER SPOT!
我们需要另一个地方！

05:35.420 --> 05:38.353
[squishing]
[压扁]

05:38.353 --> 05:39.420
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

05:39.420 --> 05:42.020
- NICE REBOUND, SPOT!
- 反弹不错，点！

05:42.020 --> 05:45.687
YOU KNOW,
I GET SQUISHED A LOT TOO.
你知道，
我也经常被压扁。

05:45.687 --> 05:46.853
[sniffles]
[抽鼻子]

05:46.853 --> 05:49.020
I HOPE NOBODY SAW
THAT EMOTIONAL OUTBURST.
我希望没有人看到
那种情绪的爆发。

05:49.020 --> 05:51.353
all: AW.
全体：AW。

05:51.353 --> 05:54.453
- SHOO!
- 嘘！

05:54.453 --> 05:55.920
OKAY, SPOT.
好的，点。

05:55.920 --> 05:58.187
TODAY, YOU'LL LEARN
HOW TO BE AN ATTACK PET
今天，您将学到
如何成为攻击宠物

05:58.187 --> 06:00.820
TO GUARD THE CHUM BUCKET
FROM INTRUDERS.
保护鱼缸
来自入侵者。

06:00.820 --> 06:03.853
NOW, SPOT,
PRETEND I'M A BURGLAR.
现在，现货，
假装我是一个窃贼。

06:03.853 --> 06:04.853
ATTACK!
攻击！

06:04.853 --> 06:06.820
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

06:06.820 --> 06:08.320
- YOU'RE NOT GETTING THIS?
- 你不明白吗？

06:08.320 --> 06:09.453
COME AT ME!
来找我吧！

06:09.453 --> 06:12.587
UH-OH,
LOSING BALANCE.
呃-哦，
失去平衡。

06:12.587 --> 06:13.853
A LITTLE HELP?
有一点帮助吗？

06:13.853 --> 06:15.720
- [boings]
- [嘘声]

06:15.720 --> 06:16.853
[barks]
[吠叫]

06:16.853 --> 06:17.953
- ON SECOND THOUGHT,
- 再想一想，

06:17.953 --> 06:19.687
WHAT DO I NEED
A GUARD DOG FOR?
我需要什么
看门狗的用途？

06:19.687 --> 06:21.687
I CAN'T EVEN GIVE CHUM AWAY.
我什至不能放弃密友。

06:21.687 --> 06:24.587
WHAT I REALLY NEED
IS A RETRIEVER.
我真正需要什么
是一只猎犬。

06:24.587 --> 06:26.753
THIS IS YOUR TARGET.
这是你的目标。

06:26.753 --> 06:30.320
I WANT YOU TO RETRIEVE
THE KRABBY PATTY.
我要你找回
蟹肉饼。

06:30.320 --> 06:32.220
NOW, SECURITY IS TIGHT,
现在，安全很严格，

06:32.220 --> 06:34.020
SO I'VE DEVISED A PL--
所以我设计了一个 PL--

06:34.020 --> 06:35.120
WAIT!
等待！

06:35.120 --> 06:36.487
WHERE ARE YOU GOING?
你要去哪里？

06:36.487 --> 06:38.353
YOU'RE NOT READY!
你还没准备好！

06:38.353 --> 06:42.287
- [sniffing]
- [嗅嗅]

06:45.153 --> 06:46.420
[pop]
[流行音乐]

06:46.420 --> 06:50.420
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

06:50.420 --> 06:53.420
- [humming cheerfully]
- [欢快地哼唱]

06:53.420 --> 06:56.820
- I'D LIKE A LARGE...
- 我想要一个大的...

06:56.820 --> 06:58.120
WHAT WAS THAT?
那是什么？

06:58.120 --> 07:00.153
- DIDN'T SEE IT,
DON'T CARE.
- 没看到，
不在乎。

07:00.153 --> 07:01.187
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

07:01.187 --> 07:02.920
[thump]
- [barking]
[扑通]
- [吠叫]

07:02.920 --> 07:04.920
- HOLY PLOT TWIST!
- 神圣的情节转折！

07:04.920 --> 07:06.320
IT'S A KRABBY PATTY!
这是蟹肉饼！

07:06.320 --> 07:09.887
IT'S...A MIRACLE!
[heavenly choir vocals]
这……真是一个奇迹！
【天籁合唱团的歌声】

07:09.887 --> 07:12.253
KAREN, LOOK
AT WHAT SPOT BROUGHT HOME.
凯伦，看
在什么地方带回家。

07:12.253 --> 07:13.720
- THAT'S WONDERFUL!
- 太棒了！

07:13.720 --> 07:15.687
SPOT DESERVES A REWARD.
SPOT 值得奖励。

07:15.687 --> 07:17.753
- HE CAN HAVE
ANYTHING HE WANTS,
- 他可以拥有
他想要什么，

07:17.753 --> 07:19.353
UP TO HALF MY KINGDOM--
我的王国的一半——

07:19.353 --> 07:20.820
UH, LABORATORY.
呃，实验室。

07:20.820 --> 07:23.087
- I THINK HE WANTS
YOUR KRABBY PATTY.
- 我想他想要
你的蟹肉饼。

07:23.087 --> 07:24.887
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

07:24.887 --> 07:27.687
[chomps]
- NOO!
[咀嚼]
- 不！

07:27.687 --> 07:28.687
NO!
不！

07:28.687 --> 07:30.687
YOU'VE BEEN A VERY BAD AMOEBA!
你是一只非常糟糕的阿米巴原虫！

07:30.687 --> 07:31.887
BAD AMOEBA!
坏阿米巴！

07:31.887 --> 07:34.320
I'M AFRAID YOU'LL HAVE
TO BE PUNISHED.
我担心你会有
受到惩罚。

07:34.320 --> 07:36.320
YOU NEED A TIME OUT.
你需要暂停一下。

07:36.320 --> 07:38.353
I'M JUST GONNA TIE YOU UP
OUT HERE
我只是要把你绑起来
在这里

07:38.353 --> 07:40.487
UNTIL YOU LEARN
TO BEHAVE.
直到你学会为止
行为规范。

07:40.487 --> 07:42.587
SHOULDN'T TAKE
MORE THAN FIVE MINUTES.
不应该采取
超过五分钟。

07:42.587 --> 07:43.987
- [whimpers, yaps]
- [呜咽，嘶哑]

07:43.987 --> 07:45.487
- AW...
- 艾维...

07:45.487 --> 07:47.720
NO, NO,
I MUST BE STRONG.
不，不，
我必须坚强。

07:47.720 --> 07:50.787
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

07:50.787 --> 07:52.820
- I CAN'T DO IT.
- 我做不到。

07:52.820 --> 07:55.553
[tender music]
SPOT, I'M SORRY. I--
[温柔的音乐]
现货，对不起。我 -

07:55.553 --> 07:56.887
[music peters out]
[音乐逐渐消失]

07:56.887 --> 07:58.920
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

07:58.920 --> 08:00.920
SPOT!
点！

08:00.920 --> 08:01.920
HE'S GONE.
他走了。

08:01.920 --> 08:03.453
[crying]
WHERE IS HE?
[哭泣]
他在哪里？

08:03.453 --> 08:05.487
SPOT! COME BACK!
点！回来！

08:05.487 --> 08:07.987
[sobbing] SPOT!
COME BACK!
[抽泣]现货！
回来！

08:07.987 --> 08:09.720
I'VE GOT TO FIND HIM.
我必须找到他。

08:09.720 --> 08:11.320
all: AW.
全体：AW。

08:11.320 --> 08:13.820
- DON'T ANY OF YOU HAVE JOBS?
- 你们都没有工作吗？

08:13.820 --> 08:14.987
SPOT!
点！

08:14.987 --> 08:17.953
SPOT!
WHERE ARE YOU, SPOT!
点！
你在哪里，现货！

08:17.953 --> 08:19.387
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

08:19.387 --> 08:21.220
- WHY, PLANKTON,
WHAT'S WRONG?
- 为什么，浮游生物，
怎么了？

08:21.220 --> 08:22.753
- I LOST SPOT.
- 我失去了位置。

08:22.753 --> 08:24.153
- THAT'S TERRIBLE!
- 太糟糕了！

08:24.153 --> 08:25.720
GARY LOST ME ONCE.
加里曾经失去过我一次。

08:25.720 --> 08:28.987
I WAS COLD, ALONE, STARVING.
我很冷，孤独，饥饿。

08:28.987 --> 08:30.487
IT WAS THE WORST EIGHT MINUTES
OF MY LIFE.
这是最糟糕的八分钟
我的生活。

08:30.487 --> 08:33.720
COME ON, PLANKTON,
LET'S FIND YOUR PET.
来吧，浮游生物，
让我们找到您的宠物。

08:33.720 --> 08:34.787
LOST PET!
丢失宠物！

08:34.787 --> 08:36.787
ANYONE SEEN THIS LOST PET?
有人看到这只丢失的宠物吗？

08:36.787 --> 08:38.387
LOST PET EMERGENCY!
丢失宠物紧急情况！

08:38.387 --> 08:40.587
BE ON THE LOOKOUT
FOR A LOST PET!
保持警惕
为了丢失的宠物！

08:40.587 --> 08:43.753
PARDON ME, SIR.
HAVE YOU SEEN THIS AMOEBA?
请原谅我，先生。
你见过这种阿米巴原虫吗？

08:43.753 --> 08:47.053
- YOU MEAN THAT LITTLE SPECK?
- NO.
- 你是说那个小斑点吗？
- 不。

08:47.053 --> 08:50.887
THAT LITTLE SPECK.
- IS THIS HIM?
那个小斑点。
- 这是他吗？

08:50.887 --> 08:52.587
- NO, THAT'S A PIECE OF GUM.
- 不，那是一块口香糖。

08:52.587 --> 08:55.253
- GUM?
- 古姆？

08:55.253 --> 08:59.553
I'VE BEEN LOOKING EVERYWHERE
FOR THIS.
我一直在到处寻找
为此。

08:59.553 --> 09:01.887
IF I WAS LOOKIN'
FOR A LOST PET,
如果我在看
对于丢失的宠物，

09:01.887 --> 09:04.120
I'D TRY THE ANIMAL SHELTER.
我会尝试动物收容所。

09:04.120 --> 09:05.353
- OF COURSE!
- 当然！

09:05.353 --> 09:07.587
both: THE SHELTER!
两者：庇护所！

09:10.387 --> 09:11.453
- I THINK IT'S CLOSED
FOR THE NIGHT.
- 我想它已经关门了
为了夜晚。

09:11.453 --> 09:12.687
[door clanks]
[门叮当作响]

09:12.687 --> 09:14.387
OOH, IT'S DARK IN HERE.
哦，这里很黑。

09:14.387 --> 09:16.387
I'LL FIND A LIGHT SWITCH.
我会找到一个电灯开关。

09:16.387 --> 09:18.020
AHA!
[switch clicks]
啊哈！
[切换点击]

09:18.020 --> 09:20.987
[metallic clank]
NO, THAT'S NOT IT.
[金属叮当声]
不，不是这样。

09:20.987 --> 09:22.387
[switch clicks]
[切换点击]

09:22.387 --> 09:24.553
AHA! FOUND THE LIGHTS.
啊哈！找到灯了。

09:24.553 --> 09:25.787
- UH, SPONGEBOB?
- 呃，海绵宝宝？

09:25.787 --> 09:28.220
WHAT WAS THAT FIRST SWITCH FOR?
第一个开关的用途是什么？

09:28.220 --> 09:29.687
- I DUNNO.
- 我不知道。

09:29.687 --> 09:31.120
I THINK IT UNLOCKS THE PENS?
我认为它可以解锁笔？

09:31.120 --> 09:32.287
- I THOUGHT SO.
- 我是这么想的。

09:32.287 --> 09:34.687
BECAUSE NOW
THE ANIMALS ARE LOOSE!
因为现在
动物们都松了！

09:34.687 --> 09:35.687
[animals shriek]
[动物尖叫]

09:35.687 --> 09:37.453
- SPONGEBOB?
- RUN FOR IT?
- 海绵宝宝？
- 为之奔跑？

09:37.453 --> 09:38.953
- YEP.
- 是的。

09:38.953 --> 09:40.220
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

09:40.220 --> 09:43.153
[animals shrieking]
[动物尖叫]

09:45.353 --> 09:46.520
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:46.520 --> 09:47.787
I THINK WE LOST 'EM.
我想我们失去了他们。

09:47.787 --> 09:50.420
- SPONGEBOB,
BEFORE WE'RE TORN TO SHREDS,
- 海绵宝宝，
在我们被撕成碎片之前，

09:50.420 --> 09:53.120
I'D LIKE TO THANK YOU
FOR HELPING ME LOOK FOR SPOT.
我想谢谢你
帮助我寻找地点。

09:53.120 --> 09:54.720
- AW, IT WAS NOTHING.
- 噢，没什么。

09:54.720 --> 09:56.220
HEY, SPEAKING OF SPOTS.
嘿，说到斑点。

09:56.220 --> 09:58.120
DID YOU ALWAYS HAVE
A DOUBLE PUPIL?
你一直有吗
双瞳？

09:58.120 --> 09:59.953
- A DOUBLE WHAT?
- 双什么？

09:59.953 --> 10:01.553
[snap]
[折断]

10:01.553 --> 10:03.253
[pop]
SPOT!
[流行音乐]
现货！

10:03.253 --> 10:05.453
[dramatic music]
THANK ENTROPY YOU'RE SAFE!
[戏剧音乐]
感谢熵，你安全了！

10:05.453 --> 10:07.920
YOU WERE HIDING
ON MY OPTICAL CORNEA
你躲起来了
在我的视角膜上

10:07.920 --> 10:09.487
THE WHOLE TIME!
一直以来！

10:09.487 --> 10:11.787
YOU SNEAKY LITTLE AMOEBA, YOU.
你这个狡猾的小变形虫，你。

10:11.787 --> 10:13.420
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

10:13.420 --> 10:15.087
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:15.087 --> 10:16.953
- AW, I'M GLAD
YOU FOUND SPOT.
- 噢，我很高兴
您找到了位置。

10:16.953 --> 10:18.087
[animals shrieking]
[动物尖叫]

10:18.087 --> 10:21.753
UNFORTUNATELY,
THE ANIMALS FOUND US TOO.
不幸的是，
动物也找到了我们。

10:21.753 --> 10:22.887
- GOOD-BYE, SPOT.
- 再见，斯波特。

10:22.887 --> 10:25.453
I GUESS THIS IS THE END
OF THE ROAD FOR US.
我想这就是结局
我们的道路。

10:25.453 --> 10:26.520
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

10:26.520 --> 10:27.853
[barks]
[吠叫]

10:27.853 --> 10:29.220
- SPOT, NO!
- 现货，不！

10:29.220 --> 10:31.053
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

10:31.053 --> 10:32.687
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:32.687 --> 10:36.553
[snarling]
[咆哮]

10:39.053 --> 10:41.053
[barking]
[叫声]

10:41.053 --> 10:43.953
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

10:43.953 --> 10:45.887
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

10:45.887 --> 10:48.087
[growls, barks]
[咆哮，吠叫]

10:49.787 --> 10:51.787
- WOW, SPOT!
YOU SAVED US!
- 哇，现货！
你救了我们！

10:51.787 --> 10:53.553
- I TAUGHT HIM
EVERYTHING HE KNOWS!
- 我教他
他知道的一切！

10:53.553 --> 10:56.053
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

10:58.687 --> 11:01.687
[lilting ukulele music]
[轻快的尤克里里音乐]

11:01.687 --> 11:09.687
**
**
**
**

**